{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hot out of the oven</strong>, the official <i><u>Slice &amp; Dice: Pizza Survival</u></i> soundtrack delivers a full platter sizzling tracks. From the  saucy daytime jams to the darker, bubbling nighttime bangers, this soundtrack is stacked like a Pizza with everything on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you really think a game about cooking wouldn\u2019t serve up an OST that\u2019s piping hot? <br>This thing\u2019s baked to perfection featuring Tracks from Co-Chefs Brightside &amp; LOV8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every track has its own topping of personality<br>Keen listeners will hear which tracks lines up with each frantic moment in the game, while casual listeners can just sink their teeth into the rich, melty soundscape on its own. <br><strong>Extra crispy, extra saucy, and guaranteed to stick to your ears like cheese to a pan.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057410?t=1767065221","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057410?t=1767065221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057410/2bbd718516358f3b3120c89970fbd2d144ebe5e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767065221","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057410/2bbd718516358f3b3120c89970fbd2d144ebe5e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767065221","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hot out of the oven</strong>, the official <i><u>Slice &amp; Dice: Pizza Survival</u></i> soundtrack delivers a full platter sizzling tracks. From the  saucy daytime jams to the darker, bubbling nighttime bangers, this soundtrack is stacked like a Pizza with everything on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you really think a game about cooking wouldn\u2019t serve up an OST that\u2019s piping hot? <br>This thing\u2019s ba